#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニタ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつも見てるのか…？
#. それはそれで飽きないのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are they always watching us? Don't they ever get tired\n"
"of it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…と、心の中で挑発するのが精一杯だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez, it took everything I had even just to *think*\n"
"about mocking them...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>教室中に血痕が飛び散っている…
#. まさに、目を覆いたくなる惨状ってヤツだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The room is covered in blood. I can hardly stand to\n"
"look at it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この教室で起きた事が、
#. 人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko and Byakuya think that \"The Tragedy\" refers to\n"
"what happened in here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、絶望的な惨状だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What happened here was desperately horrific,\n"
"absolutely.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、人類史上最大最悪は…
#. 言い過ぎじゃあ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\"the biggest, most awful, most tragic event in\n"
"human history\" kinda seems like an overstatement...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>うーん……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
